title: Indalecio Prieto
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, prietistas
card-image: img/portraits/prieto.jpg
view-if: prieto_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Indalecio Prieto

Indalecio Prieto is a newspaper publisher, brilliant orator, and leader of the party's pragmatic center.

- @coalition_lrc
- @toleration
- @snap_election
- @emergency_fundraising
- @root: Return to main

@coalition_lrc
title: Negotiating with the Left Republican Coalition
subtitle: Besteiro can improve our relationships with our coalition partners.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and in_left_republican_coalition = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government: The PSOE is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if psoe_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; ar_relation += 5; other_left_republicans_relation += 5; prrs_relation += 5

We have improved our relations with the [+ ar_name +], DLR, PRRS and various left republican parties, and reduced tensions with the coalition.
@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Prieto supports the toleration arrangement with the bourgeois parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_toleration: The PSOE is not in toleration. ?]
choose-if: psoe_in_government = 0 and psoe_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; caballeristas_dissent -= 8;

We have reduced dissent among the anti-toleration faction. 

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Prieto" or chancellor != "Largo Caballero" : We must lead the governement. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Prieto" or chancellor == "Largo Caballero")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; 

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources.
view-if: difficulty < 1
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources += dues

We have gained +[+ dues +] resources.
